WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.672
Today we will strengthen performance through reflection. Our work connects with

00:00:04.672 --> 00:00:07.517
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:11.759
Identify one timing or storytelling issue from feedback.

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:14.814
Rehearse a concrete change as a group.

00:00:16.617 --> 00:00:21.539
Restage the piece and explain the difference between the two versions. Justify a

00:00:21.539 --> 00:00:24.190
revision using evidence from another world tradition.
